Melon TSS core implementation

The DAConv/DAUNet integration and net clDice implementation are extracted/adapted
from the project's modified MMSegmentation source files. Those source files
carry: Copyright (c) Open-MMLab. All rights reserved.

MMSegmentation: Copyright 2020 MMSegmentation Authors; Apache License 2.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmsegmentation
Changes here: extracted custom modules into a standalone package, added a
namespaced registry integration, replaced the TopoSegLoss alias by DiceLoss,
and added small input/output helpers and documentation.

ConvNeXt is provided by torchvision, not vendored in this repository.
The connectivity loss follows the clDice concept, with the soft morphology
and skeleton accumulation used by this project's saved implementation.
See SOURCES.md for source hashes and references.
